# Tenancy

When changing tenant resolution, org scoping, or tests that simulate tenants, read and follow `.cursor/skills/tenancy/SKILL.md`.

Key files: `app/Http/Middleware/WebTenancyMiddleware.php` and `ApiTenancyMiddleware.php` (shared `ResolvesTenantContext` trait: org route segment, project, `x-tenant-id`; web also session), `app/Data/TenantContext.php`, `app/Http/Middleware/HandleInertiaRequests.php` (shared `tenantOrganization`), `app/Providers/AppServiceProvider.php` (route bindings), `routes/web.php` (`/orgs/{org}/…` for Inertia), `routes/api.php` (tenant via header), `tests/Concerns/InteractsWithTenant.php`.
